<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>DecodeLabs - Cloud Project 2</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a, #1e3a8a);
            color: white;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .container {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px;
            max-width: 700px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 52px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            color: #dbeafe;
        }

        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .card h2 {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .card p {
            font-size: 17px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            background: #2563eb;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">

        <h1>Welcome to DecodeLabs 🚀</h1>

        <p>
            Cloud Computing - Project 2
        </p>

        <div class="card">

            <h2>The Server Commander</h2>

            <p>
                Linux Virtual Machine successfully deployed.
            </p>

            <p>
                Apache Web Server is running successfully.
            </p>

            <p>
                Hosted on Cloud Infrastructure.
            </p>

            <span class="badge">
                DecodeLabs | Cloud Computing
            </span>

        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
